WEBVTT

00:00:09.458 --> 00:00:12.000
Descendant of the Kozunu...

00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:20.292
Do you want power,

00:00:20.292 --> 00:00:22.833
descendant of the Kozunu?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.208
Can you see the demon spirits?

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.917
Yes, there's a great number
of them flying around wildly.

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:34.167
You're sure this is the way, right, Sagaya?

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.125
Yes! Just keep on going straight.

00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:39.792
Hey, c'mon! Step on it, you guys!

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:49.917
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.417
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:01:02.417 --> 00:01:05.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:10.000
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.875
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:20.292
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:01:20.292 --> 00:01:25.458
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:29.375
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:33.292
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:38.458
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:01:38.458 --> 00:01:43.625
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.292
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:53.833
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:57.542
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:01:57.542 --> 00:02:09.167
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:23.625
That man said to me...

00:02:25.042 --> 00:02:29.833
"To exact your revenge, you will need power...

00:02:31.458 --> 00:02:37.583
...the power to violate and
obliterate the laws of this world."

00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:52.458
He told me I could obtain that power,
if I was prepared to abandon my human heart.

00:02:56.917 --> 00:02:58.708
My heart?

00:03:01.167 --> 00:03:04.792
I don't need any "heart."

00:03:04.792 --> 00:03:08.750
I abandoned that long ago.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.458
My human heart?

00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:20.625
What is a "heart"?

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:24.458
What did the "human heart" ever do for me?

00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:28.833
What did the "human heart"
ever do for my mother?

00:03:33.125 --> 00:03:39.167
Those people...
Those pigs do not deserve to live.

00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:44.417
Then kill them.

00:03:44.417 --> 00:03:46.708
There's nothing stopping you.

00:03:48.792 --> 00:03:51.458
I've been chosen.

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:54.375
I don't have to worry about those swine.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:03:58.667
Kill them!

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:01.833
Do them in!

00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:05.625
Kill them! End their lives!

00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.667
And...

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:12.458
...become a demon.

00:04:14.792 --> 00:04:20.750
I'll show you what we call the Dark Arts.

00:04:35.458 --> 00:04:36.958
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:04:36.958 --> 00:04:37.875
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Thirteenth Night"

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:39.917
"Valley of the Dark Arts"

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:43.292
Hey, what's goin' on here?!

00:04:43.292 --> 00:04:46.833
--What? A bomb?! In Shibuya? And Akasaka?!
--What? Hello? Hello!

00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:48.458
The line's been cut!

00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:52.958
Have no worries.

00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:58.167
Her barrier will not be
breached by creatures of this ilk.

00:04:58.167 --> 00:05:01.458
Is... Is that right?

00:05:01.458 --> 00:05:05.000
Hurry, you who bear the stars of fate!

00:05:06.458 --> 00:05:08.167
Wh-What the heck?

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:11.292
--What's going on here?
--My head hurts kinda...

00:05:11.292 --> 00:05:13.958
I can't see the fire god anymore.

00:05:21.417 --> 00:05:22.875
Sakurai...

00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:27.500
Aoi...

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.542
I'm coming for you now.

00:05:29.542 --> 00:05:31.333
So, what do we do now?

00:05:31.333 --> 00:05:32.792
Well, I dunno...

00:05:32.792 --> 00:05:35.250
We're damned if we do
anything, damned if we don't!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.750
Hey, you fellas head back to the hospital

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:39.792
and protect grampa,
the old bag, and the parapazzi chick.

00:05:39.792 --> 00:05:42.583
I'm countin' on you four
heavenly kings of Sumida.

00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:45.250
S-Sure thing! You stay safe too, Boss!

00:05:46.417 --> 00:05:49.542
Are you all right?
Telepathic powers can be quite a drain on you.

00:05:49.542 --> 00:05:53.208
I-I'm all right. I can feel her, just a little farther.

00:05:53.208 --> 00:05:55.167
Leave things to us from here.

00:05:55.167 --> 00:05:57.292
No, I'll go with you!

00:05:57.292 --> 00:05:59.750
You'll only get in our way.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.667
Your job's done.

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:03.625
Leave it to us from here.

00:06:03.625 --> 00:06:05.667
But...

00:06:05.667 --> 00:06:07.667
Let us pros do our thing.

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:11.000
Don't worry. We'll save
Misato, you can count on it.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.542
Mother, please be sure to watch this, Mother.

00:06:21.542 --> 00:06:24.125
This world that made you suffer like you did...

00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:27.167
This world that destroyed the Kozunu clan...

00:06:27.167 --> 00:06:32.125
Now, with my own hands, I shall make it ours!

00:06:33.125 --> 00:06:37.292
Ugh, what's that? Gross!

00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:49.292
Wh-What now?!

00:06:49.292 --> 00:06:50.750
It seems he has come.

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.708
So it would seem.

00:06:52.708 --> 00:06:55.000
Has he been awakened?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.792
The head of the Demoniacal Art?!

00:06:56.792 --> 00:07:01.458
Our beginning... The Kozunu Demon Horde!

00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:11.625
Kozunu!

00:07:12.625 --> 00:07:14.458
Oh, it's them.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.667
Good grief, you certainly are persistent.

00:07:26.667 --> 00:07:28.958
--Them?!
--They've manifested in physical forms?

00:07:28.958 --> 00:07:31.375
Forget about the small fry, it's Aoi we're after!

00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:34.125
It's him... There he is, Ryouichi!

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.458
Lightning bastard!

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:40.375
Fool...

00:07:45.417 --> 00:07:48.625
Keep your cool at least a little, you moron!

00:07:48.625 --> 00:07:49.792
Kill them.

00:07:50.792 --> 00:07:53.125
--Lord Hiyu, please leave this to us.
--Huh?

00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:54.375
Please save Misato!

00:07:56.667 --> 00:07:58.500
Yeah, just do whatever you like.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.542
Outta my way!

00:08:11.958 --> 00:08:13.125
Yukino!

00:08:24.583 --> 00:08:25.625
What the...

00:08:44.417 --> 00:08:46.042
Lady Aoi...

00:08:52.708 --> 00:08:54.292
Misato...

00:09:22.917 --> 00:09:25.792
Misato?

00:09:36.125 --> 00:09:37.458
What's the matter, lightning bastard?

00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:39.667
Shut up, don't worry about me!

00:09:53.583 --> 00:09:55.167
No, I can't, this is...

00:09:56.125 --> 00:09:58.500
What the hell are you doing?!

00:10:02.458 --> 00:10:05.250
A wall of wind! Sealed in, are we?!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.708
Big sister...

00:10:19.792 --> 00:10:20.792
Kozunu!

00:10:20.792 --> 00:10:24.250
Don't worry, I'm just
borrowing her for a little while,

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.292
until his soul has become stable.

00:10:26.292 --> 00:10:32.083
But I think I'll have a little fun
with you first, Tatsuma Hiyu.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:42.708
Go on... Aoi.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.292
Tatsuma?

00:11:04.958 --> 00:11:07.792
Tatsuma!

00:11:27.333 --> 00:11:30.125
Tatsuma!

00:11:36.542 --> 00:11:40.083
Misato...

00:11:42.333 --> 00:11:44.167
Kisaragi!

00:11:44.167 --> 00:11:45.292
Lady Aoi...

00:11:51.458 --> 00:11:53.958
I thought I told you I won't let you kill her.

00:12:02.208 --> 00:12:04.792
Misato...

00:12:04.792 --> 00:12:08.125
Misato, can you hear me?

00:12:08.125 --> 00:12:11.542
Misato, I'm sorry.

00:12:11.542 --> 00:12:14.000
I'm sorry.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:20.875
I wasn't able to do anything for you
even though you were suffering.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:28.292
I did say I was glad to have met you all, right?

00:12:28.292 --> 00:12:34.458
I'd never had friends like you guys before.

00:12:34.458 --> 00:12:39.125
I was so happy, and I said
I wanted to protect you all.

00:12:39.125 --> 00:12:43.667
That's what I felt, but...

00:12:49.292 --> 00:12:54.708
Misato, you were troubled about being
unable to protect us, weren't you?

00:12:54.708 --> 00:12:58.417
But you know, you were wrong, Misato.

00:12:58.417 --> 00:13:05.042
You know what, Misato?
You protected us many times over.

00:13:05.042 --> 00:13:08.708
Time after time...

00:13:08.708 --> 00:13:10.875
You protected us.

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:15.208
You may not have realized it,

00:13:15.208 --> 00:13:20.917
but Kyouichi, Sakurai,
Daigo, and all the others have.

00:13:20.917 --> 00:13:25.083
We were able to make it as far as we have,

00:13:25.083 --> 00:13:28.625
because you were there for us,
because you protected us.

00:13:31.458 --> 00:13:36.917
I... We all need you.

00:13:36.917 --> 00:13:39.667
I don't care what kind of power you have.

00:13:39.667 --> 00:13:43.792
We'll protect you. We'll protect you, you'll see!

00:13:45.583 --> 00:13:49.750
So, come back to us.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:53.958
Misato...

00:14:03.625 --> 00:14:04.667
This cannot be!

00:14:23.542 --> 00:14:25.583
There's no way he could have broken my spell!

00:14:25.583 --> 00:14:28.833
Aoi is... Aoi is mine!

00:14:28.833 --> 00:14:32.625
Aoi!

00:14:32.625 --> 00:14:34.958
I will protect them.

00:14:34.958 --> 00:14:40.167
I will protect each and every one of my friends!

00:14:59.667 --> 00:15:02.125
What's the matter, Doom 'n Gloom?
You're movin' kinda slow.

00:15:02.125 --> 00:15:03.667
Silence, simpleton!

00:15:03.667 --> 00:15:08.000
Hah, what's this?
You've still got some spunk left, eh?

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.458
You'd already made up your mind though, right?

00:15:10.458 --> 00:15:11.875
You...

00:15:15.375 --> 00:15:17.417
To protect...

00:15:25.417 --> 00:15:28.792
Fight to protect...

00:15:29.667 --> 00:15:33.250
K-Kill her! I have no further use for that woman!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:36.542
Kill the Bodhisattva Eye and all the rest of them!

00:15:36.542 --> 00:15:37.542
Let's go!

00:15:42.125 --> 00:15:43.125
Daigo!

00:15:43.125 --> 00:15:46.958
I thought I told you that I'm gonna protect you!

00:15:53.792 --> 00:15:55.125
Kisaragi!

00:15:58.625 --> 00:16:00.917
Even if it costs me my life...

00:16:03.417 --> 00:16:05.833
All your attacks are totally cliché!

00:16:05.833 --> 00:16:08.042
You simpleton!

00:16:15.625 --> 00:16:18.417
I guess this is where I make my exit.

00:16:18.417 --> 00:16:21.500
This is all 'cuz you didn't listen to his orders.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.583
You sure look dumb now.

00:17:28.958 --> 00:17:30.625
Mother!

00:17:34.417 --> 00:17:38.708
That's your hatchet, motherfucker!
I made sure to give it back to ya!

00:18:00.292 --> 00:18:02.708
Does this mean...

00:18:02.708 --> 00:18:05.792
Those boys and their friends did it.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.625
It's over?

00:18:19.625 --> 00:18:22.125
Huh? Those two are gone!

00:18:22.125 --> 00:18:23.875
What?! No way...

00:18:23.875 --> 00:18:25.875
We screwed this one up pretty good, huh?

00:18:25.875 --> 00:18:28.208
Now we won't be able to get anywhere!

00:18:28.208 --> 00:18:30.167
I'll never be able to face the boss!

00:18:42.375 --> 00:18:43.458
Hey!

00:18:44.833 --> 00:18:48.583
There's a jamboree, right?

00:18:48.583 --> 00:18:50.125
You mean "jam session."

00:18:50.125 --> 00:18:51.833
Guys!

00:18:54.125 --> 00:18:56.667
--Takamizawa...
--We had to come after all.

00:18:56.667 --> 00:18:59.167
Sagaya, you've come to!

00:18:59.167 --> 00:19:00.917
Yes, and you too!

00:19:00.917 --> 00:19:03.542
What are you two doing here?

00:19:03.542 --> 00:19:08.500
We might get in your way; we might not
be able to do anything at all, but...

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.500
But!

00:19:14.958 --> 00:19:16.167
You scum...

00:19:16.167 --> 00:19:17.750
Please stop this!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:22.625
I felt your sorrow when I
came in touch with your heart.

00:19:22.625 --> 00:19:26.458
I know you were trying to cast
away that sadness by doing this.

00:19:26.458 --> 00:19:26.958
But--

00:19:26.958 --> 00:19:28.792
Quiet!

00:19:28.792 --> 00:19:34.458
Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! Quiet!

00:19:34.458 --> 00:19:38.292
You scum, you bastards...

00:19:41.042 --> 00:19:42.833
Hiyu?

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:55.583
Tendo Kozunu...

00:19:55.583 --> 00:19:59.875
I want to save you too.

00:19:59.875 --> 00:20:02.500
Don't give me that crap!

00:20:06.708 --> 00:20:07.792
Hiyu!

00:20:09.167 --> 00:20:10.708
Kyouichi!

00:20:11.917 --> 00:20:14.583
Why do you despise the Kozunu line so much?!

00:20:14.583 --> 00:20:16.792
You're the one who gave birth to me!

00:20:16.792 --> 00:20:20.292
This world... You stinking people!

00:20:20.292 --> 00:20:22.458
You all made me!

00:20:22.458 --> 00:20:28.583
This world can... It can just... It can just...

00:20:33.917 --> 00:20:36.708
Even so...

00:20:36.708 --> 00:20:40.417
Even so, I...

00:21:05.458 --> 00:21:09.625
It... It's not over yet.

00:21:09.625 --> 00:21:11.083
Not yet...

00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:15.125
I won't lose yet!

00:21:15.125 --> 00:21:18.583
Mother, make sure you watch, okay?

00:21:18.583 --> 00:21:21.792
I can still do it, I...

00:21:24.625 --> 00:21:26.208
I...

00:21:31.917 --> 00:21:33.000
What's that?

00:21:42.958 --> 00:21:44.458
How?!

00:21:47.167 --> 00:21:48.292
What is this?

00:21:49.292 --> 00:21:52.417
No, let go! Let go of me!

00:21:52.417 --> 00:21:54.625
Why? Why are you...

00:21:54.625 --> 00:21:55.292
Kozunu!

00:21:55.292 --> 00:21:56.917
What are you doing?! Get back!

00:21:56.917 --> 00:21:57.917
But...

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:03.042
No! Why, Lord Yagyu?!

00:22:03.042 --> 00:22:04.958
Lord Yagyu!

00:22:09.083 --> 00:22:11.542
--This looks real bad!
--Let's get out of here, quickly!

00:22:11.542 --> 00:22:13.417
Hiyu!

00:22:13.417 --> 00:22:15.458
Give it up already, you dope!

00:22:15.458 --> 00:22:16.458
Let's go!

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:28.458
One star has fallen.

00:22:30.458 --> 00:22:34.208
Foolish Tendo Kozunu...

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.375
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.375 --> 00:22:52.458
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.458 --> 00:22:56.708
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.708 --> 00:23:01.625
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.583 --> 00:23:12.917
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.917 --> 00:23:14.792
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.042
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.042 --> 00:23:27.583
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.583 --> 00:23:32.000
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.167 --> 00:23:37.792
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.792 --> 00:23:43.458
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.458 --> 00:23:47.792
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.792 --> 00:23:53.083
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.083 --> 00:23:58.167
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:06.875 --> 00:24:07.917
"Next Episode"

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:13.833
"Dark Arts Chapter Fourteenth Night Falling Star"

00:24:13.833 --> 00:24:17.046
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Fourteenth Night Falling Star"
